<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12859] .NET: Services fail to call method with DateTime or Guid argument</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12859</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;.Net service proxy can&apos;t find java method with Timestamp or UUID datatype.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13295903">IGNITE-12859</key>
            <summary>.NET: Services fail to call method with DateTime or Guid argument</summary>
